flowchart LR
  C[Untrusted local caller] --> L[Loopback TLS and CSRF boundary]
  L --> F[Restricted frontend process]
  F --> I[Authenticated bounded RPC]
  I --> B[Broker under separate OS identity]
  A[Private authority store] --> B
  B --> H[Domain and human quorum plus revision commit]
  H --> P[Broker-owned project snapshot and files]
